  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Southeast Asia Clean Energy Fund II Private sector acceleration Technical Assistance Facility(&amp;prime;24-&amp;prime;29/$5,600,000)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Market building and Pilot projects 2. Support the operational scale-up of TA recipients 3. Supports addressing and raising awareness on environmental, social, and governance-related issues</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of SEACEF2 is accelerating the low carbon transition in Southeast Asia.  Significant capital is urgently required to stem greenhouse gas emissions growth. The secondary objective is attracting private sector capital.&#xd604;&#xc9c0; &#xc77c;&#xc790;&#xb9ac; &#xcc3d;&#xcd9c;, &#xc7ac;&#xc0dd;&#xc5d0;&#xb108;&#xc9c0; &#xc0dd;&#xc0b0; &#xb4f1;</narrative>
